			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Mahiru"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 20040601,
					"content": "Ah... You must also be here to try and convince Tejima to stay?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040602,
					"content": "What's happened?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20040603,
					"content": "Tejima has protected this place ever since he arrived here 30 years ago.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040604,
					"content": "Keeping out the Treasure Hoarders, fending off any monsters that draw near, resolving quarrels between the villagers... he has put an enormous amount of work into looking after this place, and we all think the world of him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040605,
					"content": "But now, all of a sudden, he says he plans to leave us... We can't help but wonder — was it something we did?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040606,
					"content": "We will gladly apologize if that's the case... All we want is for him to stay...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 200407,
			"completionStepIds": [
				200407
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"200407",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 200407,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Kenjirou"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 20040701,
					"content": "*sigh* ...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kenjirou"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040702,
					"content": "So why the change?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040703
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20040703,
					"content": "If you want my opinion, something to do with the Vision Hunt Decree.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kenjirou"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040704,
					"content": "It's clear that Tejima had done nothing wrong. And still they confiscated his Vision. After that... he became a completely different person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kenjirou"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040705,
					"content": "I can't claim to fully understand it, but I could tell that he'd lost something very important to him. He went off on a walk, alone, circled the village a few times, and then out of the blue, he announced that he was going to leave and become a wanderer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kenjirou"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040706,
					"content": "Truth be told, we aren't sure whether trying to keep him here is the right thing to do. But equally... it doesn't feel right to let him leave when he's in this state. He's a lost soul.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kenjirou"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040707,
					"content": "Seems like he's a well-respected guy around here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 200408,
			"completionStepIds": [
				200408
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"200408",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 200408,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Paimon",
					"Tejima"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 20040801,
					"content": "You must be Tejima? So, what's made you wanna up and leave all of a sudden?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040802,
					"content": "Me...? I... It's not a question of why I want to leave... but a question of... what reason I would have to stay.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040803,
					"content": "You've lived here for a long time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040804
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20040804,
					"content": "Everyone depends on you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 20040805,
					"content": "True... but that's not why I chose to stay here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040806,
					"content": "...and what made me want to come here 30 years ago? And why have I never wanted to leave in all that time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040807,
					"content": "*sigh* I don't have answers to those questions, because I can't remember anymore. Ever since they took my Vision away, it's like... a slice of my memory is gone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040808,
					"content": "In the past, I knew I wanted to stay here... but whatever resolve I had then, it's gone now. So I thought, what's to stop me from moving around instead? The emptiness inside me will be there either way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040809,
					"content": "Okay... Well, in that case, if we help you rediscover the reason you chose to stay, you won't need to leave anymore, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040810,
					"content": "Hmm... But if you can't remember anything, it's not gonna be easy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040811,
					"content": "Oh! Maybe if you just try a little harder to remember, then... it'll all come flooding back?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040812,
					"content": "Oh, that reminds me... Last time I brought Tejima some fruit, I do believe I saw him writing in a diary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040813,
					"content": "...I keep a diary? If you say so... I honestly can't seem to remember.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Tejima"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040814,
					"content": "Yes, yes, you do! And what's more, I remember you saying at the time that you wanted to make a note of a few interesting things — things which would prove very important at a later date.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040815,
					"content": "Perfect! So, if we wanna keep Tejima from leaving, we just need to find his diary. It must be around here somewhere, let's take a look.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						20040816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 20040816,
					"content": "If you don't mind, we will leave you to find the diary... we should head back to the village to inform the others of Tejima's situation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mahiru"
				}
			]
		},
